# SOC Home Lab Architecture

## Overview

This project documents the construction of a personal Security Operations Center (SOC) home lab designed to simulate an enterprise Windows environment.

The objective is to gain practical experience with:

- Windows Endpoint Monitoring
- Active Directory
- SIEM Administration
- Log Collection
- Threat Detection
- Attack Simulation
- Incident Investigation

The lab is built entirely inside Oracle VirtualBox.

